  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "50",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 50"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "50",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "*Psaume d'Asaph. Le [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "] Fort",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", a parlé, et a appelé la terre, du soleil levant jusqu'au soleil couchant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "De Sion, perfection de la beauté,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a fait luire sa splendeur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Notre",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "viendra, et il ne se taira point ; un feu dévorera devant lui, et autour de lui tourbillonnera la tempête ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il appellera les cieux d'en haut, et la terre, pour juger son peuple :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Assemblez-moi mes saints",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", qui ont fait alliance avec moi par [un] sacrifice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et les cieux déclareront sa justice, car",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lui-même est juge. Sélah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Écoute, mon peuple, et je parlerai ; [écoute], Israël, et je témoignerai au milieu de toi. Moi, je suis",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ton",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je ne te reprendrai pas à cause de tes sacrifices ou de tes holocaustes, qui ont été continuellement devant moi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je ne prendrai pas de taureau de ta maison, ni de boucs de tes parcs ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car tout animal de la forêt est à moi, les bêtes sur mille montagnes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je connais tous les oiseaux des montagnes, et ce qui se meut par les champs est à moi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si j'avais faim, je ne te le dirais pas ; car le monde est à moi, et tout ce qu'il contient",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mangerais-je la chair des gros taureaux, et boirais-je le sang des boucs ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sacrifie à",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "la louange, et acquitte tes vœux envers le Très-haut,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et invoque-moi au jour de la détresse : je te délivrerai, et tu me glorifieras.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mais",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dit au méchant : Qu'as-tu à faire de redire mes statuts, et de prendre mon alliance dans ta bouche ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toi qui hais la correction",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", et qui as jeté mes paroles derrière toi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si tu as vu un voleur, tu t'es plu avec lui, et ta portion est avec les adultères ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu livres ta bouche au mal, et ta langue trame la tromperie ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu t'assieds, tu parles contre ton frère, tu diffames le fils de ta mère :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as fait ces choses-là, et j'ai gardé le silence ; – tu as estimé que j'étais véritablement comme toi ; [mais] je t'en reprendrai, et je te les mettrai devant les yeux.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
